    "rationale": "Raises the kept cc-two-hold-mult (+10.9) from +mult to ×mult, and makes the downgrade enablers that measured very badly on their own (become [2]s) worth considering. The decision it changes is mainly in the shop and at Opening, which is a mild departure from 'changes a play decision'; a wild combo with uc-low-to-twos is acceptable because it needs luck.",
